<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score on the first day of the four-day Sheffield Shield match between New South Wales and Queensland on Thursday. New South Wales first innings 190 (Steve Waugh 55, Andrew Bichel six for 56); Queensland first innings 89 for two.</p>
</text>
